OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly freezing fog patches
OL,6,Fclear slowly during the morning. The
OL,7,Fday will stay mostly dry and after a
OL,8,Fmostly cloudy start to the morning,
OL,9,Fbright or sunny spells will increase
OL,10,Finto the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe evening will continue dry
OL,13,Fwith clear periods. Cloud will
OL,14,Fincrease at times from the late
OL,15,Fevening but will clear from midnight,
OL,16,Fleading to a frosty morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
