OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThe morning will begin
OL,6,Ffrosty and dry, leading to a bright
OL,7,Fand sunny day with cloud restricted to
OL,8,Fthe east coast where an odd shower is
OL,9,Flikely.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLess
OL,12,Fcold from Friday. Cloud will increase
OL,13,Fas scattered showers build in the west
OL,14,FFriday. Scattered showers continue
OL,15,FSaturday with outbreaks of rain
OL,16,Ffollowing from the southwest Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
